WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,990
Our stairs can't find this path at all

2
00:00:02,990 --> 00:00:06,940
Sure enough it rained heavily

3
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:08,420
You have so much meat here

4
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:10,100
Guzhen Bacon

5
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:12,540
Former ham sister

6
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:17,600
I think I saw it, don’t look

7
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:20,520
She said she was a little dizzy

8
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:24,130
Come down faster than luck would like

9
00:00:24,130 --> 00:00:29,900
Our people are all down there

10
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:31,460
Sister, you are so bright

11
00:00:31,460 --> 00:00:33,060
The face is so tender that you can pinch water out of it

12
00:00:35,840 --> 00:00:36,760
Well done

13
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:41,260
This time I will serve you to the table, Sister Liu.

14
00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:44,460
Don't go yet, don't be afraid
